description	"Pre-Mor Authority Security

Corpo Security with insider specialized weaponry, focused on holding objectives.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more Kb
-- 50% less Reach
-- 33% more Radius
- Guard Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 25% faster RoF
-- 35% less Dmg
-- 40% less FP Dmg
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]"
